✨ 01. ABOUT THE PROJECT

Personal Portfolio Website is a modern frontend project developed as part of the Oasis Infobyte Web Development & Designing Internship — Level 1, Task 2.

The project represents my professional digital identity through a visually engaging and responsive website.

It introduces Muhammad Yaseen, professionally known as Yaseen Baloch, a Computer Science undergraduate and aspiring Software Engineer passionate about programming, web development, AI automation, and technology.

The website combines a premium dark interface, purple visual accents, modern typography, elegant content cards, and responsive layouts to create a distinctive digital experience.

🎯 02. PROJECT OBJECTIVES

* Build a professional personal portfolio website.
* Present personal identity and educational background.
* Showcase technical skills and development interests.
* Highlight selected projects and practical work.
* Demonstrate modern HTML5 and CSS3 techniques.
* Create responsive layouts for different screen sizes.
* Provide accessible professional and social contact links.

